{
  "name": "GitHub Issue + PR Templates",
  "description": "Bug report and feature request issue forms plus a pull request template under .github/ (multi-file)",
  "files": [
    {
      "path": ".github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.md",
      "body": [
        "---",
        "name: Bug report",
        "about: Something does not work as expected",
        "title: \"\"",
        "labels: bug",
        "assignees: \"\"",
        "---",
        "",
        "## What happened",
        "",
        "## What you expected to happen",
        "",
        "## Steps to reproduce",
        "",
        "1. ",
        "2. ",
        "3. ",
        "",
        "## Environment",
        "",
        "- Version:",
        "- Operating system:",
        "",
        "## Logs or screenshots"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": ".github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature_request.md",
      "body": [
        "---",
        "name: Feature request",
        "about: Suggest an idea or an improvement",
        "title: \"\"",
        "labels: enhancement",
        "assignees: \"\"",
        "---",
        "",
        "## The problem",
        "",
        "What are you trying to do, and what gets in the way?",
        "",
        "## The solution you would like",
        "",
        "## Alternatives you have considered"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": ".github/pull_request_template.md",
      "body": [
        "## Summary",
        "",
        "${cursor}",
        "",
        "## Why",
        "",
        "## How it was tested",
        "",
        "- [ ] Tests added or updated",
        "- [ ] Documentation updated",
        "",
        "Closes #"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
